Brand logo clear space and minimum size
title end

paragraph start
Clear space is an empty margin kept around the logo, measured in a unit taken from the mark itself. Minimum size is the smallest size at which the logo still reads on a phone.
paragraph end

paragraph start
Both values are measured on the final logo, not guessed, and written here with an example image.
paragraph end

